OL,3,GNEWSAFreeze on fuel duty and tax cut on
OL,4,Apints agreed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncome tax allowances will go up by the
OL,7,Flevel of inflation, fuel duty will be
OL,8,Ffrozen and tax on a pint at the pub
OL,9,Fwill be cut in 2027 as the States of
OL,10,FGuernsey agreed a budget of more than
OL,11,F#716m in spending.
OL,13,FPolicy & Resources (P&R) had offered
OL,14,Fpoliticians two alternative budgets,
OL,15,Fone with 1% real terms spending cuts,
OL,16,Fknown as option A, and the other with
OL,17,Fan extra #15m, or option B. Option B
OL,18,Fwas approved.
OL,20,FThere were 12 amendments asking for
OL,21,Fextra spending but only one passed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
